# Replicaz Cursor Rules

## State management (mandatory)

- Use **flutter_bloc `Bloc` only** — never Cubit, never Riverpod
- Events + Equatable states with `part` / `part of` triad
- Dispatch events from UI: `context.read<XBloc>().add(...)`
- StatelessWidget by default; StatefulWidget only for UI controllers
- BlocBuilder / BlocListener with buildWhen / listenWhen
- No SnackBar for success paths

## Structure

```
features/{name}/bloc/ + data/ + presentation/pages|widgets
core/bootstrap, storage, theme, widgets
```

## UI

- Messenger-first: chats are the center
- Syne (brand) + Plus Jakarta Sans (UI)
- Soft mist background, bubbles, identity switcher in header
- Avoid generic bordered ListTile cards for chat lists

